      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "要",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "好了，《Code Geass 反叛的鲁路修》你们应该都已经提前看过，/n不过我还是重新说明一遍。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20034010170",
      "CharacterMotions": [
